-- double_sweep.tsv: DuckDB's DOUBLE for DECIMAL(38, s) values, 1000 of them: the stored integer
-- (u, as digits), its scale, the decimal text, and CAST(.. AS DOUBLE) printed (shortest
-- text that reads back exactly). Values on both sides of 2^53, 2^63 and 2^64, negative ones
-- within 2^64 of zero, and seeded random ones of 1 to 38 digits.
